id: devil
name: Devil
order: 2
category: body
# A Factor Trait replaces a Secondary Racial Trait - Secondary, then, unless it names a Primary one to replace.
importance: secondary
# (1)
grantsOther: bestial, monstrous
grantsOtherFrom: winged-beast, unique-monstrosity
# (2)
grantsUnique: magical-materialization
description: >
  From the depths of HFIL, your darkness spreads as you manifest in the land of the living.
text: >
  Devil (Body): From the depths of HFIL, your darkness spreads as you manifest in the land of the living.
  (1)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Winged Beast Bestial Traits and the Unique Monstrosity Monstrous Trait.
  (2)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Magical Materialization Unique Ability.
  (3)-[Passive]: For the Unique Monstrosity Monstrous Trait, you may select any Unique Ability regardless of the TP Cost (follow the usual restrictions for Unique Monstrosity).

---

# (1), (2) Its headers: Winged Beast and Unique Monstrosity in the Other Traits list, Magical Materialization - each gained with it.
[passive]
# (3) Unique Monstrosity's choice, of any TP Cost (racial.mjs).
allow devil.anyUnique;
